CM_ SG_ 407 RM_EgoLaneWidth_m_oRM_EGOLANE_IN "Lane width estimation of currently driven lane. Positive per definition.";
CM_ SG_ 407 RM_EgoLaneC0_m_oRM_EGOLANE_INFO_ "Lane center topology estimation of currently driven lane - C0 coefficient of 3rd order polynomial, origin: center of rear axle of host vehicle. y(x) = C0 + C1 * x + C2 * x^2 + C3 * x^3. Negative to the left";
CM_ SG_ 407 RM_EgoLaneC1_1_oRM_EGOLANE_INFO_ "Lane center topology estimation of currently driven lane - C1 coefficient of 3rd order polynomial, positive to the right. y(x) = C0 + C1 * x + C2 * x^2 + C3 * x^3. Negative to the left";
CM_ SG_ 407 RM_EgoLaneC2_1pm_oRM_EGOLANE_INF "Lane center topology estimation of currently driven lane - C2 coefficient of 3rd order polynomial, sign according to C1. y(x) = C0 + C1 * x + C2 * x^2 + C3 * x^3. Negative to the left";
CM_ SG_ 407 RM_EgoLaneC3_1pm2_oRM_EGOLANE_IN "Lane center topology estimation of currently driven lane - C3 coefficient of 3rd order polynomial, sign according to C2. y(x) = C0 + C1 * x + C2 * x^2 + C3 * x^3. Negative to the left";
CM_ SG_ 407 RM_EgoLaneComposition_oRM_EGOLAN "Composition of topology estimation of currently driven lane. Bits are set, if the corresponding input is available, plausible and fused into topology estimation. Bit0: LF_PC_VIDEO_LEFT; Bit1: LF_PC_VIDEO_RIGHT; Bit2: LF_PC_OBJ_TRAJ_A; Bit3: RESERVED";
CM_ SG_ 407 RM_EgoLaneWidthStd_m_oRM_EGOLANE "Standard deviation of lane width estimation of currently driven lane. Standard deviation reflects quality and availability of measurements. Positive per definition.";
CM_ SG_ 407 RM_EgoLaneLateralStdC0_m_oRM_EGO "Lateral standard deviation of topology estimation of currently driven lane - C0 coefficient of 3rd order polynomial, positive per definition. Lat_std(x) = C0 + C1 * x + C2 * x^2 + C3 * x^3.";
CM_ SG_ 407 RM_EgoLaneLateralStdC3_1pm2_oRM_ "Lateral standard deviation of topology estimation of currently driven lane - C3 coefficient of 3rd order polynomial. Lat_std(x) = C0 + C1 * x + C2 * x^2 + C3 * x^3.";
CM_ SG_ 407 RM_EgoLaneLateralStdC2_1pm_oRM_E "Lateral standard deviation of topology estimation of currently driven lane - C2 coefficient of 3rd order polynomial. Lat_std(x) = C0 + C1 * x + C2 * x^2 + C3 * x^3.";
CM_ SG_ 407 RM_EgoLaneLateralStdC1_1_oRM_EGO "Lateral standard deviation of topology estimation of currently driven lane - C1 coefficient of 3rd order polynomial. Lat_std(x) = C0 + C1 * x + C2 * x^2 + C3 * x^3.";
